# Foodie Fit Engineering & Image Rules

## 1. Image & Photography Policy

- **NO FAKE AI IMAGES**: Never generate, mock, or use synthetic AI-generated meal images or artificial placeholders.
- **ONLY REAL IMAGES**: Use strictly authentic food photography downloaded directly from Foodie Fit's Meal Prep Tech (MPT) production API/Azure Blob storage (`/images/meals/`) or verified brand media assets.
- **Asset Paths**: Serve all product images locally from `/images/meals/[slug].jpg` or verified MPT CDN endpoints.

---

## 2. Security & Commerce Perimeter Rules

- **Commerce System Isolation**: Keep public marketing pages isolated from customer order/account systems.
- **Strict Allowlist**: All outbound order/account links must validate through `CommerceUrlAllowlist`.
